description	"Pre Vizsla 
 
A fearsome Deathwatch leader with many integrated weapons and martial skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- The Darksaber (Cyan/Purple/Red)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
- Dual WESTAR-35 Blaster Pistols (3)
-- 5% more Dmg/FP Dmg
-- 10% slower RoF
- Thermal Grenades (5)
- Wrist Microsaws (E-22 1)
-- 100% FP Drain
-- 40% More Damage
-- 2 Shots Per Mag, Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Fuel Regen (2)
- 25% Less Knockback Taken
- Beskar (2)
- Healing (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Dexterity (1)
- Anti Mindtrick (1)
- Env Protect (1)
- Rally
- 400%+ Cooldown on Abilities

^3Abilities: 
- Jetpack
- Rocket ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS4]
-- Knocks down/Slows on Hit"
